omx-contract (3.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release: omx-contract 3.3.0
  * test: the packaging tests read three packages, and hold omx-contract-data
  * packaging: the run-time data in omx-contract-data, a noarch package (#150)
  * docs: how a package declares its verbs, and why the kind is a minor
  * test: a package's verbs installed, rendered from the directory and
    refused by code
  * semver: a verb added is minor, a verb removed is major
  * render: omx_host_verbs.h, every verb of the read and what each host owes
    it
  * schema: the verbs kind, reply codes and the hosts a verb names
  * private-refs-check reads a tree another user owns, as a CI container
    checks it out (#1478)
  * public-sources exempts the shared private-refs gate, which names what it
    forbids (#1478)
  * Add the shared private-refs gate with its self-test to the Makefile and
    CI (#1478)

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:17:59 +0000
